// Apparel: worn in a slot, protecting the body parts it covers. Armor values are 0..1 against
// sharp (cut, pierce, bite), blunt and heat (burn) damage. A hit on a covered part is turned
// with chance (armor - the weapon's penetration); otherwise its damage is cut by half that much.
// Absorbing blows wears the item down (maxHp); it falls apart at 0.
// "worn" is the layer sheet drawn over a person wearing it (presentation only; see docs/ART.md).
// Packs go in the Back slot and carry items up to "container.capacity" kg (their own mass not
// counted); they're always bulky (hands only, never in another pack). Bigger packs are just more defs.
